{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHoptale\u300b is a Roguelite with a core of \u201cHopscotch \u00d7 Slot Machine.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, gather, fish, and solve puzzles through hopscotch gameplay; <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/a9ae2def2730f754ea884f4197a3ee82.poster.avif?t=1765949448\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/a9ae2def2730f754ea884f4197a3ee82.webm?t=1765949448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/a9ae2def2730f754ea884f4197a3ee82.mp4?t=1765949448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, the tiles transform into a slot machine, and you must lock onto safe paths to defeat monsters;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/eaab4ba23a961b34309e630d560c0687.poster.avif?t=1765949448\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/eaab4ba23a961b34309e630d560c0687.webm?t=1765949448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/eaab4ba23a961b34309e630d560c0687.mp4?t=1765949448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even loot and rewards are decided by the slot machine\u2014your fate lies in your reflexes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3074730/extras/13ee8febdaf9c9b03fc85afb9d934d00.poster.avif?t=1765949448